messages.en:
{07 1d 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}Whoa!{01 00 00 0f 00} Look at that! You've
collected quite a few fish
there, {01 00 00 14 00}{07 14 00}haven't you!
{01 00 00 0a 00}{07 1b 00}You don't look like it, {01 00 00 0a 00}
but you're a DO-er, huh?{01 00 00 0f 00}
Huh.{01 00 00 0a 00} {07 14 00}Who knew, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}?

messages.et:
{07 1d 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}Ohoo!{01 00 00 0f 00} Vaata seda! Sa oled
päris palju kalu
kogunud, {01 00 00 14 00}{07 14 00}kas pole!
{01 00 00 0a 00}{07 1b 00}Sa ei näe välja nagu, {01 00 00 0a 00}
aga sa oled TEGIJA, mis?{01 00 00 0f 00}
Ah.{01 00 00 0a 00} {07 14 00}Kes teadis, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}?

messages.en:
{07 15 00}I'd like to catch
{04 1a 00}, so
tell me if you see one!
{07 00 00}One of my goals is to catch{07 05 00}
one{01 00 00 05 00}--no, ten!--of those{01 00 00 05 00}
today, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!

messages.et:
{07 15 00}Tahaksin püüda
{04 1a 00}, nii et
ütle, kui mõne näed!
{07 00 00}Üks mu eesmärkidest on{07 05 00}
püüda üht{01 00 00 05 00}--ei, kümmet!--{01 00 00 05 00}
täna, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!
